01:39:38.560 --> 01:39:40.320 line:63%
 Monsieur le ministre, 
 l'installation d'étudiants 

01:39:40.480 --> 01:39:41.600 line:63%
 ultramarins 
 en poursuite d'études 

01:39:41.760 --> 01:39:46.880 line:63%
