01:45:20.400 --> 01:45:21.280 line:63%
 ou renforcer 
 l'accès aux soins, 

01:45:21.440 --> 01:45:23.200 line:61%
 par exemple. 

01:45:23.360 --> 01:45:24.560 line:61%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: Merci. 

01:45:24.720 --> 01:45:26.600 line:61%
 Madame la députée? 

01:45:26.760 --> 01:45:28.800 line:63%
 - Christine Decodts: 
 J'accueille 

01:45:28.960 --> 01:45:34.200 line:61%
